# Development-only / not needed by the runtime image:
# - raw source documents: only the persisted storage/ artifacts are read at runtime
# - docs, research, tests: not imported by the running app
# - manual_tests: a diagnostic script run against an already-running server
# - project docs / AI usage notes: reviewer-facing, not application code
data/
docs/
research/
tests/
manual_tests/
.claude/
README.md
AI_USAGE.md
cli.py
